{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021224346694-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021231857\"/><p>清潔工人當日清理扶手梯的血漬。</p><p>上月25日中秋節，一名姓郭(58歲)男子在荃灣街市街千色匯二期商場乘搭扶手電梯時，懷疑突然暈倒，繼而跌落梯級受傷。事主當場昏迷，送往仁濟醫院搶救後情況危殆，他留醫近一個月後，延至今日(21日)傍晚約6時半被證實死亡。據悉，事主有身體病紀錄。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:41:42.226272+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:37:46.377502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:37:46.377502+00:00","content_hash":"d3c1ca5c769a49dcd5851feac8261c874474c6ac6a05697188fb06dc38db86b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}